Drain queued streaming audio before ticking and emit whole-recording text.

Bias tokio::select! toward reading queued audio chunks so slow CPU passes
do not drain one chunk per inference after stop, and send
StreamingEvent::Whole when the recording stayed inside one window so
non-typing file-output sessions receive the full-context pass.

